    </style>
    <div
      class="sc-kzTWdp cJYAYe"
      id="garden-metaphor-section"
    >
      <div
        class="sc-fcXOXp eSIsID"
      >
        <div>
          <div>
            <h2
              class="sc-kghAKo eLKraP"
            >
              The Garden Metaphor: Growing Your Project
            </h2>
          </div>
          <div
            style="margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"
          >
            <h3
              class="sc-bMgOzA kAZVTg"
              style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"
            >
              A Carefully Designed Environment
            </h3>
            <p
              class="sc-kghAKo fTnaPA"
            >
              Just as a garden needs structure, care, and the right environment to thrive, AI Brain Garden provides a carefully designed environment where your project's knowledge and AI interactions can grow and flourish.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            style="background-color: rgb(240, 255, 244); padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;"
          >
            <div
              class="sc-hfLMuB dReviF"
            >
              <div
                style="width: 100%; height: 600px;"
              >
                <div
                  style="width: 100%;"
                >
                  <div
                    class="sc-gDVcuj Ngstd"
                  >
                    <div
                      style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"
                    >
                      <div
                        class="sc-jnflPq faBCiO"
                      >
                        <div>
                          Initializing diagram...
                        </div>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                      aria-label="Diagram description"
                      class="sr-only"
                      role="note"
                    >
                      Garden Metaphor Diagram showing the three phases of a Brain Garden project's growth: Seed Phase (Initial Setup, Knowledge Structure, Core Prompts), Sprout Phase (Cultivating Patterns, Testing & Refining, Expanding Capabilities), and Mature Phase (Self-Improving, Context-Aware, Continuously Adapting)
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div
              style="text-align: center; margin-top: 1.5rem;"
            >
