          <h3
            class="sc-kghAKo bOISvj sc-dAUvXN kMGOG"
          >
            MECE Documentation Structure
          </h3>
          <p
            class="sc-kghAKo fuQEuZ sc-EzLrM cWeCwZ"
          >
            Like well-organized garden beds, the Brain Garden's Mutually Exclusive, Collectively Exhaustive (MECE) documentation structure ensures every aspect of your project has a clear, defined place. This organizational approach prevents gaps in knowledge and eliminates redundancy, creating a clean, comprehensive knowledge foundation that's easy to navigate and maintain.
          </p>
          <div
            class="sc-joCsvb gjyhEr"
          >
            <p
              class="sc-kghAKo fuQEuZ sc-gshHPa eIrmNK"
            >
              Problems Solved
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p
        class="sc-kghAKo fuQEuZ sc-kwpGQH XLuQD"
      >
        The Knowledge System transforms how project intelligence is managed—from static documentation that quickly becomes outdated to a living ecosystem that continuously grows in value. Like a well-tended garden that becomes more beautiful and productive over time, your project's knowledge base becomes increasingly valuable with each interaction, enabling your AI assistants to function as true extensions of your development team rather than generic tools.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
`;

