                  </div>
                  <div
                    class="sc-hhfthL dUFTNS developer-tools"
                  >
                    Developer Tools
                  </div>
                </div>
                <div
                  class="project-content"
                >
                  <div
                    class="project-main"
                  >
                    <div
                      class="sc-fScmHt hrlbdh project-description "
                    >
                      <div
                        class="sc-fPyrPm sc-bmCFzp jROUkn cCpMJs"
                      >
                        <p
                          class="markdown-paragraph"
                        >
                          AI-Brain-Garden is a command line tool designed to revolutionize software development by creating project-specific "Brains," structured knowledge bases that integrate templates, rules, and AI agents.
                        </p>
                        

                        <h2
                          class="markdown-h2"
                        >
                          Key Features
                        </h2>
                        

                        <ul
                          class="markdown-list"
                        >
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Context-aware assistance
                            </strong>
                             - Provides AI help that understands your specific project
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Customizable agents
                            </strong>
                             - Configure specialized AI helpers for different tasks
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Integrated task management
                            </strong>
                             - Track and prioritize development activities
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Dynamic cursorrules
                            </strong>
                             - Automatically enforces coding standards
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Atomic design for prompts
                            </strong>
                             - Creates reusable, modular AI instructions
                          </li>
                          

                        </ul>
                        

                        <p
                          class="markdown-paragraph"
                        >
                          By addressing the inefficiencies of current AI tools, it offers a unique, highly customizable solution for developers and project managers seeking to streamline workflows and improve project outcomes.
                        </p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                      class="sc-DYLTT idiXxj"
                    >
                      <div
                        class="sc-fPyrPm sc-bmCFzp jROUkn cCpMJs"
                      >
                        <p
                          class="markdown-paragraph"
                        >
                          <strong
                            class="markdown-strong"
                          >
                            Created a framework
                          </strong>
                           that enhances structure for Enterprise AI-assisted development workflows
                        </p>
                      </div>
