                    <div
                      class="sc-fScmHt hrlbdh project-description "
                    >
                      <div
                        class="sc-fPyrPm sc-bmCFzp jROUkn cCpMJs"
                      >
                        <p
                          class="markdown-paragraph"
                        >
                          A TypeScript tool that enhances developer productivity by automatically documenting project structures and providing AI-powered insights. Features include project structure documentation automation, AI-powered file and function descriptions using Google Gemini, real-time file monitoring and updates, automatic project type detection, multi-project support with dedicated documentation, Cursor IDE integration via .cursorrules, smart caching system for performance optimization, customizable ignore patterns, and interactive project setup.
                        </p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                      class="sc-DYLTT idiXxj"
                    >
                      <div
                        class="sc-fPyrPm sc-bmCFzp jROUkn cCpMJs"
                      >
                        <p
                          class="markdown-paragraph"
                        >
                          Streamlines development workflows by creating intelligent, self-updating documentation that gives developers and AI assistants deeper understanding of complex codebases.
                        </p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                    <div
                      class="sc-gcbYvb fZuTm"
                    />
                  </div>
