                              Designed and created this two-page case study showcasing Saturn's transformation of a legal research firm's failing SAS environment. Crafted compelling visuals and persuasive copy highlighting dramatic performance improvements (386% faster processing, 689% faster data operations), which equipped sales team members with powerful collateral for targeted client outreach.
                            </p>
                          </div>
                        </div>
