                    <div
                      class="sc-fScmHt hrlbdh project-description "
                    >
                      <div
                        class="sc-fPyrPm sc-bmCFzp jROUkn cCpMJs"
                      >
                        <p
                          class="markdown-paragraph"
                        >
                          A comprehensive web application that empowers users to create fully-voiced audiobooks through an intuitive interface. It combines AI-powered script generation with advanced text-to-speech technology, allowing storytellers to focus on developing rich narratives and characters while automating the technical aspects of audiobook production.
                        </p>
                        

                        <h2
                          class="markdown-h2"
                        >
                          Key Features
                        </h2>
                        

                        <ul
                          class="markdown-list"
                        >
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Story management
                            </strong>
                             with chapter organization
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Character creation
                            </strong>
                             with customizable attributes (personality, appearance, background)
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              AI-powered script generation
                            </strong>
                             using OpenAI's GPT models
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Voice customization
                            </strong>
                             for characters and narrators
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Text-to-speech conversion
                            </strong>
                             using advanced voice APIs
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Script version history
                            </strong>
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Plot mapping
                            </strong>
                             with relationship visualization
                          </li>
                          

                          <li
                            class="markdown-list-item"
                          >
                            <strong
                              class="markdown-strong"
                            >
                              Multi-voice compilation
                            </strong>
                             for complete audiobooks
                          </li>
                          

                        </ul>
                      </div>
